{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        139.17019653320312,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "7.1 CHAPTER OBJECTIVES",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.6211242675781,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This chapter describes the areas in which information is lacking, as identiﬁed by the expert",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58220291137695,
        72.27304077148438,
        66.27020263671875,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "panel.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58220291137695,
        102.09934997558594,
        227.52322387695312,
        111.09934997558594
      ],
      "text": "7.2 INFORMATION GAPS AND RESEARCH NEEDS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.60020065307617,
        120.27005004882812,
        399.8370361328125,
        129.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "The panel identiﬁed major gaps in the evidence for use of contact investigation as a routine",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.67219924926758,
        132.26705932617188,
        399.8369445800781,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "intervention in TB control. There is no evidence that identiﬁcation and evaluation of contacts",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.6631965637207,
        144.26406860351562,
        399.7085876464844,
        153.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "reduces TB incidence or mortality. Although studies of the impact of the intervention would",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5437126159668,
        156.27304077148438,
        401.6344909667969,
        165.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "be difﬁcult, a cluster randomized or step-wedge design would be a reasonable approach.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50770950317383,
        168.27005004882812,
        399.71746826171875,
        177.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "In addition, mathematical modelling, including cost–effectiveness estimates, would provide",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55270767211914,
        180.26705932617188,
        399.9783020019531,
        189.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "useful information. A comparison of contact investigation with other forms of active case",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8137092590332,
        192.26406860351562,
        399.8973388671875,
        201.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "ﬁnding could provide information to guide the choice of interventions, although contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.858707427978516,
        204.26107788085938,
        280.4794006347656,
        213.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "investigation is best implemented by TB control programmes.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52840042114258,
        222.27593994140625,
        399.6930847167969,
        231.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "A major weakness in the literature is the lack of standardized protocols for studies. Such",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5193977355957,
        234.27294921875,
        399.61212158203125,
        243.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "standardization would allow comparisons of use of the same approach under different",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57339859008789,
        246.26995849609375,
        399.61224365234375,
        255.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "conditions and enable identiﬁcation of country-speciﬁc barriers to implementation. Different",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57339859008789,
        258.2669677734375,
        400.12677001953125,
        267.2759704589844
      ],
      "text": "approaches to contact investigation, in particular use of an active versus a passive approach,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52077865600586,
        270.2728576660156,
        399.4518737792969,
        279.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "have not been evaluated. Moreover, different screening and clinical evaluation algorithms have",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.28677749633789,
        282.2698669433594,
        119.93878173828125,
        291.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "not been compared.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.28677749633789,
        300.2698669433594,
        399.4604187011719,
        309.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "There is limited information on approaches to and the value of contact investigation in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.28677749633789,
        312.2668762207031,
        399.37994384765625,
        321.2668762207031
      ],
      "text": "settings with a high prevalence of HIV infection, including testing of contacts as part of routine",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.214778900146484,
        324.2638854980469,
        399.1996154785156,
        333.2638854980469
      ],
      "text": "evaluation. Undertaking contact investigations in such settings would require overcoming",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.016780853271484,
        336.2608947753906,
        399.7484436035156,
        345.2789001464844
      ],
      "text": "signiﬁcant operational and technical barriers. The current recommendation is to test new",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58378219604492,
        348.27276611328125,
        399.7151794433594,
        357.2759094238281
      ],
      "text": "cases of TB for HIV. Ideally, contacts in settings with a high prevalence of HIV infection should",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55050277709961,
        360.269775390625,
        399.70648193359375,
        369.269775390625
      ],
      "text": "also be tested. It is clear that treatment of LTBI in people with HIV infection reduces their risk",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53250503540039,
        372.26678466796875,
        400.1829528808594,
        381.26678466796875
      ],
      "text": "for TB, but it has not been established whether treatment of contacts with HIV infection,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5775032043457,
        384.2637939453125,
        399.7235107421875,
        393.275634765625
      ],
      "text": "regardless of whether they have been infected, is beneﬁcial. Both operational investigations",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5496940612793,
        396.27264404296875,
        282.03070068359375,
        405.27264404296875
      ],
      "text": "and clinical trials will be necessary to answer these questions.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55869674682617,
        414.27264404296875,
        399.7144470214844,
        423.27264404296875
      ],
      "text": "There is also insufﬁcient information on the yield of contact investigations when the index",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54069900512695,
        426.1333923339844,
        399.7144775390625,
        435.2696533203125
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis case has TB caused by drug-resistant  . Systematic investigation of contacts of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.549678802490234,
        438.26666259765625,
        399.6965026855469,
        447.26666259765625
      ],
      "text": "known or suspected cases of MDR-TB and XDR-TB may be effective for reducing transmission",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52267837524414,
        450.13641357421875,
        401.6369323730469,
        459.2752380371094
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis of drug-resistant strains of   in a community, although this is not proven.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.509883880615234,
        462.2722473144531,
        399.54864501953125,
        471.2722473144531
      ],
      "text": "In addition, contact investigation may reduce morbidity and mortality by shortening the time",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.38388442993164,
        474.2692565917969,
        399.7200927734375,
        483.2692565917969
      ],
      "text": "to diagnosis and initiation of effective treatment. There has been little systematic investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5458869934082,
        486.2662353515625,
        399.72869873046875,
        495.2662353515625
      ],
      "text": "of the epidemiology of MDR-TB and XDR-TB, and the potential role of transmission to adults",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55488967895508,
        498.2632141113281,
        399.73773193359375,
        507.2722473144531
      ],
      "text": "and children who are household contacts has not been well quantiﬁed. Operational",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57290267944336,
        510.2691955566406,
        399.7621765136719,
        519.27099609375
      ],
      "text": "investigations, clinical trials and mathematical modelling will be necessary to prove this",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.588191986083984,
        522.2680053710938,
        113.79617309570312,
        531.2680053710938
      ],
      "text": "presumed beneﬁt.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.588191986083984,
        540.2680053710938,
        399.96905517578125,
        549.2680053710938
      ],
      "text": "More generally, the use of any of the treatment regimens for LTBI in high-incidence, low-income",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.804195404052734,
        552.2649536132812,
        400.1849060058594,
        561.2649536132812
      ],
      "text": "settings in the framework of contact investigation requires further investigation. Smieja et al.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.64219284057617,
        564.261962890625,
        399.70782470703125,
        573.2709350585938
      ],
      "text": "(41) in 1999 systematically reviewed 11 randomized controlled clinical trials of isoniazid",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54319381713867,
        576.2679443359375,
        399.60662841796875,
        585.269775390625
      ],
      "text": "preventive therapy for 6–12 months and found that treatment resulted in a relative risk for",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.441707611083984,
        588.2667846679688,
        399.41766357421875,
        597.2667846679688
      ],
      "text": "active TB of 0.40 (95% conﬁdence interval, 0.31–0.52) over 2 years or longer. Only two of these",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.25270462036133,
        600.2637939453125,
        399.24639892578125,
        609.2637939453125
      ],
      "text": "studies, however, were conducted in high-burden, low-income countries, and many other",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.08170700073242,
        612.2608032226562,
        399.0489196777344,
        621.2608032226562
      ],
      "text": "factors, such as feasibility, drug availability and cost, must be considered before recommending",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.87470626831055,
        624.2578125,
        365.9901123046875,
        633.2758178710938
      ],
      "text": "routine treatment for LTBI as a component of contact investigation in such settings.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        216.9918975830078,
        651.97265625,
        225.21939086914062,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "44",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}